# Never publish readable simulator sources. They belong in the private
# sources repository only. This list exists because an earlier repository
# published them by accident.
#
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash so they match ONLY the repo
# root. The open XIRR tool legitimately ships tool/app.js, tool/styles.css
# and sim/tests/*.test.js, and must never be caught by these.
/master.html
/master.*.html
/engine.js
/assemble.js
/app.js
/styles.css
/BUILD_BRIEF.md
/body.html
/css_add.css
/ui_*.js
*.built.html
*.v2pre.html
/build-sources/
/v2/
/tools/
/tests/

# Ordinary noise
*.pyc
__pycache__/
node_modules/
package-lock.json
.DS_Store
